 content types are:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - matches interest well (成像原理、不同条件下的调整)\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - matches interest well (实际拍摄方法)\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - matches interest (学习)\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation - about exhibitions, artist biographies, art history) - less relevant (摄影师私生活/艺术活动历史背景)\n- 市场观察 (market observation - camera purchase packages, promotions, celebrity endorsements) - NOT relevant (器材促销)\n\nThe interest explicitly says: 不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活 (not interested in equipment promotions or photographers' private lives).\n\nSo I should avoid:\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - equipment promotions\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about exhibitions, artist biographies, art history, viewing experience - this is more about 摄影师私生活/艺术活动\n\nI should prefer:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles)\n- 操作记录 (operation records)\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n\nLet me identify the candidates that match the interest well. Let me categorize the candidates by their content type.\n\nLet me look at the candidates and identify which are 条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览 (the relevant types).\n\nLet me go through the list:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d - 静物布光：低照度室内中的市场观察 - MARKET (exclude)\n2. item-03a565217024 - 运动追焦：窗边自然光中的专题观察 - EXHIBITION (exclude)\n3. item-03b7af37b88f - 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e - 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n5. item-061d97575247 - 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的条件与原理 - INCLUDE\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3 - 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n7. item-07bfbf16235d - 微距景深：低照度室内中的市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n8. item-090691086c5b - 夜景曝光：低照度室内中的市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0 - 微距景深：黄昏户外中的概念速览 - INCLUDE\n10. item-0a19145321ef - 街头构图：窗边自然光中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n11. item-0b78ff27e538 - 微距景深：阴天街道中的市场观察 - EXCLUDE\n12. item-0ca34ef0a880 - 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的概念速览 - INCLUDE\n13. item-10d5a61a7f0a - 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的操作记录 - INCLUDE\n14. item-11c4e3cb9cf2 - 街头构图：黄昏户外中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n15. item-11d6f8fe3226 - 街头构图：低照度室内中的专题观察 - EXCLUDE\n16. item-12a571ccfc9e - 逆光人像：阴天街道中的操作记录 - INCLUDE\n17. item-143